---
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import { contactEmail } from "../content";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const updated = "28 September 2026";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy policy · Sochana"
  description="How Sochana uses the information you send through the booking form on this site."
>
  <Header />
  <main class="wrap">
    <article class="policy">
      <span class="eyebrow">Last updated {updated}</span>
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="lede">This page explains what we collect when you send us a request through the form on this site, and what we do with it.</p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>When you submit the booking form, we receive:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>your name</li>
        <li>your work email</li>
        <li>your company</li>
        <li>your role</li>
        <li>the fraud concern you selected</li>
        <li>your message</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We don't ask for anything else, and the form doesn't collect payment or card details.</p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>We use it only to respond to your inquiry: to reply to you and to arrange a call if you want one.</p>

      <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
      <p>
        We don't sell your information or share it with anyone else. Form submissions are stored by our website host,
        Netlify, which delivers them to us.
      </p>

      <h2>Deleting your information</h2>
      <p>
        To ask us to delete what you sent us, email <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>. We'll confirm
        once it's done.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy: <a href={`mailto:${contactEmail}`}>{contactEmail}</a>.</p>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  main { padding-top: clamp(24px,4vw,56px); padding-bottom: clamp(64px,7vw,96px); }

  .policy { max-width: 680px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }

  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(34px,4vw,52px);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -.035em;
    color: var(--text-strong);
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  h2 {
    margin-top: 24px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 22px;
    letter-spacing: -.01em;
    color: var(--text-strong);
  }

  p, li { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--text-body); }
  .lede { font-size: 18px; color: var(--text-muted); }
  ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
  a { color: var(--text-accent); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  a:hover { color: var(--text-strong); }
</style>
